  "worked_solution": "Let's sketch the trajectory.\n\n- We start at the given point and go along with the flow (straight to the right) until the trajectory intersects the $y$-nullcline, where the tangents are horizontal.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068149/assets/0d010be8bad72bf4ebac4dbe2d325f1a1f194d78c676e2a62306b5c7d2af3c66.png)\n\n- Next, the flow continues going to the right  but then starts turning downward.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068149/assets/5118424696b9602f10bf116c3a292e2fb58ed2f9acd2a9507888ab92a9b8986b.png)\n\n- After that, the trajectory continues to move rightward and bend downward, converging to the origin.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068149/assets/92a58573efafd7155cf02faf52e27ab968d9161ad448530b45673fd83a61fde1.png)",
