  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-332920\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Let's sketch the trajectory.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>We start at the given point and go along with the flow (straight to the right) until the trajectory intersects the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"211\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-nullcline, where the tangents are horizontal.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-dc976fb577f5187d23760a65d4874275\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/dc976fb577f5187d23760a65d4874275\"></div>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Next, the flow continues going to the right  but then starts turning downward.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-18492b32d7f567f087379bd8c4e9010f\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/18492b32d7f567f087379bd8c4e9010f\"></div>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>After that, the trajectory continues to move rightward and bend downward, converging to the origin.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-ffdc0f08e343854d6aa5b13983b12fa7\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/ffdc0f08e343854d6aa5b13983b12fa7\"></div><div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-332920-a-4\"></div></div>",
